  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/03-act3-crownlands/frame-191.jpg"

  "Qarth Alliance Split near the godswood throws you into a city where rumor outruns law by half a day. Wet wool, horse sweat, and lamp oil mix in the courtyards where petitioners queue behind shield walls. Merchants and minor lords crowd the gallery, each pretending loyalty while pricing your weakness by the hour. The promises made in Act Two still echo from Castle Black to the river roads, and every missed shipment turns into a political weapon in the capital.

Crowd control politics leaves no neutral ground; public discipline stabilizes legitimacy but invites open challenge, while covert coercion quiets districts and teaches everyone that fear is the only currency. Every order now carries two prices, one immediate and one deferred, and your rivals are betting you can only afford one of them.

You can feel the margin narrowing in hard values: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. By dawn, the city will remember whichever method you chose, not the reason you chose it."

  choice__
    @target "T192 - ACT3 - The Wall War Map against old law"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action crown_trust = clampStat(crown_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Announce penalties in daylight, trade speed for legitimacy, and make your own name answerable with the rest."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T193 - ACT3 - Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Task Varys with deniable purges of ringleaders, pay in secrecy and conscience, and retake districts before the bells."
  __choice
__section

section__
  @title "T192 - ACT3 - The Wall War Map against old law"
  @textPacing "cinematic"
  @shot "wide"
  @backdrop "https://example.com/thrones/03-act3-crownlands/frame-192.jpg"

  "The Wall War Map against old law throws you into a capital already cracking under ration lines and patrol fatigue. Sea wind carries brine, tar, and rot from Blackwater Bay while torch smoke hangs low over the alleys. Court clerks bring conflicting writs, septons demand visible justice, and street captains ask who will absorb the blood cost of compliance. Decisions that held the realm together in Act Two have arrived as unpaid invoices, and each faction expects to be paid first.

This is regime enforcement in its ugliest form: if you choose transparent process, you spend time and prestige; if you choose hidden pressure, you gain speed while corroding trust in the same chain of command you need tomorrow. Crowd control politics leaves no neutral ground; public discipline stabilizes legitimacy but invites open challenge, while covert coercion quiets districts and teaches everyone that fear is the only currency.

Your ledger is stripped to numbers: honor=${honor}, ruthlessness=${ruthlessness}, secrecy=${secrecy}, leverage=${leverage}, war_readiness=${war_readiness}, wealth=${wealth}, north_trust=${north_trust}, crown_trust=${crown_trust}, watch_trust=${watch_trust}, essos_ties=${essos_ties}, dragon_factor=${dragon_factor}, survival_clock=${survival_clock}. You are not deciding whether to pay, only who gets the first claim on your authority."

  choice__
    @target "T193 - ACT3 - Castle Black Inheritance Claim under moonless sky"
    @action honor = clampStat(honor + 1, 0, 30)
    @action crown_trust = clampStat(crown_trust + 1, 0, 30)
    @action war_readiness = clampStat(war_readiness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Read the decree at the city gates, spend prestige to prove equal enforcement, and lock the Gold Cloaks to recorded law."
  __choice

  choice__
    @target "T194 - ACT3 - Moat Cailin Whispered Warning at the gatehouse"
    @when ((secrecy + leverage) >= 5)
    @action ruthlessness = clampStat(ruthlessness + 1, 0, 30)
    @action secrecy = clampStat(secrecy + 1, 0, 30)
    @action leverage = clampStat(leverage + 2, 0, 30)
    @action survival_clock = clampStat(survival_clock - 1, 0, 30)
    "Use Bronn and paid dock crews for night seizures, keep your seal off the violence, and reassert control by dawn."
  __choice
__section
